"Nightora turns your Quest into a home theater for the library you already have.\n\n\u2022 Big-screen browsing: Home, Discover, Movies, Shows, Anime, Live TV and Catalogs, with rich detail pages, ratings and trailers.\n\u2022 Native playback: a hardware-accelerated video player with subtitle and audio-track choices and subtitle timing adjustment.\n\u2022 Set up from your PC: open Nightora on your computer, choose Send to device, and your account, add-ons and settings arrive on the headset. No typing passwords in VR.\n\u2022 Profiles that follow you: each person gets their own profile, watch history and Continue Watching, synced across your PC and Quest. Kids profiles have their own safe space.\n\u2022 Your add-ons, your choice: Nightora works with the Stremio add-on ecosystem. Install the add-ons you want; Nightora shows what they provide.\n\u2022 Watch together: start a shared session with friends.\n\nNightora is an independent client. It does not host, store or distribute any media, and it is not affiliated with Stremio or any content provider. You are responsible for the add-ons you install and the content you access through them.", "short_description": "Nightora is a media center for Meta Quest. Browse movies, shows, anime and live TV from the Stremio add-ons you choose, on a big screen with smooth native playback. Set it up from Nightora on your PC in seconds, and your profiles, library and Continue Watching stay in sync. Nightora doesn't host or provide any content; what you can watch depends on the add-ons you install."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://nightora.vercel.app/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "RealChroma", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://nightora.vercel.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING", "GAMEPAD"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1458723263986415"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1796437371650139"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1796437371650139"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1794342540, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1796437371650139"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1460772217114853", "version": "0.9.147"}, "id": "3522021114642974", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1458723257319749", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1460772217114853"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "3522021114642974"}]}, "change_log": "- Pandora's Box shows under Trackers in the settings sidebar again, so you can paste your two-way sync token and connect.\n- Searching settings for Pandora's Box finds it.", "created_date": 1794352204, "id": "1460772217114853", "version": "0.9.147", "version_code": 9148, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "Androi